    <string name="about">About BlazeMessenger</string>
    <string name="about_body">BlazeMessenger is a private messaging app. Passwords are handled by Firebase Authentication and are never stored in the app. Chat files are downloaded with your signed-in session, not through public links. Version %1$s.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">BlazeMessenger stores your profile, messages, and call signaling in your Firebase project. It does not upload your phone contacts. Notification text can be hidden in settings. Incoming calls respect silent mode and Do Not Disturb and cannot override every manufacturer battery restriction.</string>
